{"unit_id":"LaoQianwocao__dsh-sound-player#card-zh","repo":"LaoQianwocao/dsh-sound-player","commit":"4197960588f4d9d6f033387fa0cb606ea19ebd2f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-player 是面向 DSH 官方桌面端的音效播放器，所有操作集中在设置页。它监听对话完成、发送消息、权限请求、提问、服务断开和子代理运行状态，并为这些情况播放提示音。用户可以在内置合成音、系统提示音和 meme 音效中选择，也能导入自己的音频。每条情况可单独调整音量、播放区间和渐弱效果，并可试听或停止。适合希望通过声音跟踪 DSH 会话事件的桌面用户；无需 API Key，导入音频保存在本机音效库。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:85-88","client.js:705-878","client.js:1389-1558","lib/index.js:191-270"]}
{"unit_id":"LaoQianwocao__dsh-sound-player#card-en","repo":"LaoQianwocao/dsh-sound-player","commit":"4197960588f4d9d6f033387fa0cb606ea19ebd2f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sound-player adds alerts for DSH desktop events like completed turns, permissions, disconnections, and subagent completion. Users select built-in or imported sounds in settings, adjust each alert’s volume and playback range, apply a fade, and preview or stop playback. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:85-88","client.js:705-878","client.js:1389-1558","lib/index.js:191-270"]}
